Returns a list of L<Getopt::Long> option specifications for the command-line
options for the C<add> command.

code_original:
sub options {
    return qw(
        change-name|change|c=s
        requires|r=s@
        conflicts|x=s@
        note|n|m=s@
        all|a!
        template-name|template|t=s
        template-directory=s
        with=s@
        without=s@
        use=s%
        open-editor|edit|e!
    );
}

