Resets iteration. Same as C<< $plan->position(-1) >>, but better.

=head3 C<next>

  while (my $change = $plan->next) {
      say "Deploy ", $change->format_name;
  }

Returns the next L<change|App::Sqitch::Plan::Change> in the plan. Returns C<undef>
