=head3 C<rework>

  $plan->rework( 'whatevs' );
  $plan->rework( 'widgets', [qw(foo bar)], [qw(dr_evil)] );

Reworks an existing change. Said change must already exist in the plan and be
tagged or have a tag following it or an exception will be thrown. The previous
